| `routes/bulkAnalysis.js` | 67 KB | 🔴 | Core scheduling logic mixed with HTTP routing. Extremely high risk of race conditions during modifications. |
| `routes/weeklyWatchlist.js` | 43 KB | 🟠 | High frequency of recent modifications and complex conditional branching. |

